      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\n<b>MODEL KITS OF PLANES, CARS, SHIPS AND MORE!</b><br><br>\n<a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.com\">HEARNS HOBBIES</a> have a vast variety of model kits to cover every interest. Whether your interest is <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/aircraft\">aircraft</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/armour\">military vehicles</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/model-kit-cars\">cars</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/plastic-model-buildings\">buildings</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/movie-tv\">movie subjects</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/ships\">ships</a> or <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/gundams\">Gundam</a> we have it all. We also have a range of wooden kits which extends to ships and planes. Our team has extensive knowledge in model making including scratch building &amp; painting so they can offer the advice on what is the best kit for you regardless if you are a beginner or a more advanced modeller.\n<br><br>\nWe are leading supplier for hobbies in Melbourne and in Australia since 1947; since then we have been committed to bring into Australia the models and the tools that you need to create the diorama of your dreams!\n<br><br>\nKey brands and leading manufacturer of plastic model kits are: <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/arifix\">Airfix</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/tamiya\">Tamiya</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/trumpeter\">Trumpeter</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/italeri\">Italeri</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/copper-state-models\">Copper State model</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/bandai\">Bandai</a> and many more.\n</div>\n<button class=\"expandable-content__toggle\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    </button>\n</div>"
      }
    },
